{"4968400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chlorine Scales", "steam_appid": 4968400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An illustrated point-and-click mystery and exploration game. Explore the city's grimy backstreets, question its inhabitants, and collect mysterious Chlorine Scales to make sure you can pay your rent on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>About Chlorine Scales</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven days left...to pay the rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a responsible tenant, it's your duty to pay your rent every month. Unfortunately, you only have seven days left to scrape together the money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's just one problem: you're completely broke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no other choice, you'll have to wander the city's grimy backstreets, searching for anything that might help you survive another month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the hidden corners of a city caught in the grip of a housing crisis, barter with its eccentric inhabitants, and uncover the secret behind the mysterious Chlorine Scales. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to fortune is anything but straightforward, and there is more than one way to reach your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you pay your rent before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/8724b68556c1d69fed490b35bdd881f1.poster.avif?t=1787906319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/8724b68556c1d69fed490b35bdd881f1.webm?t=1787906319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/8724b68556c1d69fed490b35bdd881f1.mp4?t=1787906319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore a non-linear city</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a bizarre assortment of items, from kebabs to crack pipes, to solve puzzles, strike deals, or survive encounters with the city's more dangerous residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as time remains, so does hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/168e99e2fb1b1e67b1a4652bc7223fca.poster.avif?t=1787906319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/168e99e2fb1b1e67b1a4652bc7223fca.webm?t=1787906319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/168e99e2fb1b1e67b1a4652bc7223fca.mp4?t=1787906319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A surreal point-and-click adventure</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments that blend photography with hand-drawn illustrations to create a distinctive visual style. Piece together the city's mysteries through environmental storytelling and conversations with its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some people will help you, others will expect something in return. A few would rather see you disappear. When words are no longer enough, settle your disputes in 3D battles that reveal another side of the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/deabd720551b34a09b828b0b8f5026af.poster.avif?t=1787906319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/deabd720551b34a09b828b0b8f5026af.webm?t=1787906319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/deabd720551b34a09b828b0b8f5026af.mp4?t=1787906319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Built for multiple playthroughs</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the city through unlockable game modes, hidden secrets, and multiple endings. Experience the story from the perspective of different playable characters, each introducing unique mechanics and their own interpretation of the city's strange reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/f63a13c1e1a6fa7e1ca7ffd1e21771c2.poster.avif?t=1787906319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/f63a13c1e1a6fa7e1ca7ffd1e21771c2.webm?t=1787906319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968400/extras/f63a13c1e1a6fa7e1ca7ffd1e21771c2.mp4?t=1787906319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An illustrated point-and-click mystery and exploration game. Explore the city's grimy backstreets, question its inhabitants, and collect mysterious Chlorine Scales to make sure you can pay your rent on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>About Chlorine Scales</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\